<view class="wrap">

  <view class="card hero">
    <view class="t1">🎬 视频教程</view>
    <view class="t2">搜「菜名 + 做法」才能搜到做菜内容；只搜菜名会混进吃播和综艺。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="lab">菜名</view>
    <input class="q" placeholder="如：番茄炒蛋" value="{{q}}" bindinput="onInput" confirm-type="search" />

    <view class="kwbox">
      <text class="kwlabel">实际搜索词</text>
      <text class="kw">{{kw}}</text>
    </view>

    <view class="btn primary" bindtap="onCopyWord">📋 复制搜索词（推荐）</view>

    <view class="lab" style="margin-top:26rpx">或者复制带筛选的链接</view>
    <view class="plats">
      <view wx:for="{{platforms}}" wx:key="key" class="plat" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindtap="onPlatform">{{item.label}}</view>
    </view>

    <view class="btn ghost mt" bindtap="onCopyAll">复制搜索词 + 全部链接</view>
  </view>

  <view class="sec"><view class="bar2"></view><view class="t">热门菜</view></view>
  <view class="chips">
    <view
      wx:for="{{hot}}"
      wx:key="*this"
      class="{{q == item ? 'chip on' : 'chip'}}"
      data-n="{{item}}"
      bindtap="onHot"
    >{{item}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card tip">
    <view class="tipt">用了哪些筛选</view>
    <view class="tipc">
      · 搜索词统一加「做法」，避开吃播、探店、商品<br/>
      · B站链接带 <text class="mono">tids_1=211</text>（美食分区）<br/>
      · 抖音链接带 <text class="mono">type=video</text><br/>
      · 小红书带 <text class="mono">source=web_search_result_notes</text><br/><br/>
      网页版部分平台要登录，所以**优先用「复制搜索词」在 App 里搜**，结果最准。
    </view>
  </view>

</view>
